    <div class="card full">
      <h2>Who may reach which page</h2>
      <p class="note">The dashboard, the published ban list and the health check all answer on
        port 443, so a firewall cannot tell them apart; nginx can. Each is everybody, or only from
        the addresses and networks named (IPv4 and IPv6). This machine itself is always let in.</p>
      <div id="fw-access"></div>
    </div>
