    used !== null ? used + ' % used' : '–', total ? bytes(total) + ' in all' : '',
    'How much of its memory is in use.'));
  cards.appendChild(tCard('info', 'Up for', res.uptime || '–',
    Object.keys(r.health || {}).slice(0, 3).map(function (k) {
      return k + ' ' + r.health[k]; }).join(' · '),
    'How long it has been up, and what its sensors say (temperature, voltage, fans), where it '
