    + 'account and its key are right.',
  'cfg-export': 'Download everything configured here as one JSON file — the settings, the '
    + 'accounts and what they may do, what is never banned, and who is banned now. No '
    + 'passwords, no ssh key and no certificate: this is the file that can be mailed, '
    + 'committed or pasted into a ticket. A machine built from it comes up correct in every '
